            <String CONTENT="» habet dilectionẽ: nõ aliter illi lege opus eſtiq̃ ſano medicina. Ideo ſubdit Paulus, ⁋Fi¬" HPOS="541.0" VPOS="1910.0" WIDTH="1610.0" HEIGHT="54.0"/>
          </TextLine>
